msgid "Store credit %s: this order carries a charge record that cannot be read, so the credit was left alone. Check the credit before treating this order as paid by it."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: coupon code */
#: includes/class-ubac-credit-core.php:1517
msgid "Store credit %s: this order claims a charge on that credit but the amount recorded cannot be read, and the order no longer carries the coupon line to fall back on, so nothing was returned. Check the credit and refund it by hand if something is owed."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: coupon code */
